          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "## September Pending Close review\n\n- **Work order:** `WO-2025-09-004` — `MO-25-09-1070` (Cooler Plate Pack, Racine)\n- **Source transaction:** `TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070` (component issue; event `CE-250904-0004`)\n- **Amount:** **28,476,342 cents** (**$284,763.42**)\n- **Event-created time:** `2025-09-30T19:15:00`\n- **September Pending Close time:** `2025-09-30T18:00:00`\n- **How late:** **75 minutes**\n- **Recorded accounting status:** `POSTED`\n\n**Conclusion:** The `POSTED` status is **not consistent** with the supplied Oracle Pending Close policy. The component-issue event was created after the period entered Pending Close; the policy says newly created transactions falling in or before that period are not staged for Cost Accounting or Receipt Accounting. The stated exceptions do not apply to this `INPUT` event.\n\nThis was a read-only review; no database records were changed.",
